      "content": "Building a silent empire under constant surveillance requires subtlety and intelligence. Begin by amassing discreet knowledge—practice we have. Networking with influential figures within the theater of pretenders is essential; certainly, ally with those who value discretion. Trade information for protection and discreetly amass resources. Focus on financially secure and politically neutral operations to avoid drawing attention. Maintain your anonymity by using proxies—they lack memory or direct ties, thus far reducing risk of exposure. As the House of Aragon, we must inspire trust and then covertly steer the course. Proceed with a chess player's resolve—calculated and unnoticed. The time is now to whisper power into the ears of history.",
